  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.27 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration of Medical Technicians",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.27 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration of Medical Technicians. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.27, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of registration of medical technicians under RSA 328-I:\n\nTable 1002.27 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration of Medical Technicians\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nMedical technician registration application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $121\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
